<title>CANADA: SNC-Lavalin may build Kiev complex.</title>
<headline>SNC-Lavalin may build Kiev complex.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>SNC-Lavalin Group Inc said Friday it had signed a letter of intent with Kyivmiskbud, a local constructor, to build a C$400 million business complex in the Ukrainian capital Kiev.</p>
<p>It said it must first seek out investors interested in participating in financing the project, which would include a convention center, hotel, office tower, shopping center and parking.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
